+ *   guest pairs     reaper 2026-11-16: an Access Intranet pair between two guest networks = forwarding between those
+ *                   two only, as the stock pair rule grants it; both stay closed to the router and to the main LAN.
+ *                   Never for a portal, never with a network that is itself paired with the Main Network
  * Hooked by hook.sh (rc/reaper_hook.c) right after Warden; re-applied at every firewall build's tail and after every
- * guest-network change. The main LAN (br0) and networks with intranet access are never touched.
